{"obsah":"<p>The municipality of Čestlice invited us to the opening of its pump track, with us providing the complete programme. </p>\n\n<p>The sound system, Trial exhibition and workshop were all on us. The Čestlice pump track is bigger than the ones in Stránčice or Nupaky and is fully asphalt. Our task was a roughly one-hour programme consisting of a Trial show and a pump track workshop together with Katarína and the guys from the club. </p>\n\n<p>After us came a smaller exhibition on the workout playground. At first it didn't look like a big turnout, but in the end lots of spectators and riders gathered and rushed onto the pump track after the show.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2F303474266_479022070751715_7128065680536675493_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2F303474266_479022070751715_7128065680536675493_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211689\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2F303486479_787976845581489_5260573185963643495_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2F303486479_787976845581489_5260573185963643495_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211687\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2F303669075_424214133141684_836159499251651485_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/b